        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "Did you catch that?\n\nThe new maxed out 256GB M5 Ultra Studio can be leased for *basically* the same price as a Max subscription across providers. \n\nFor $257 a month, you can have on device intelligence that never runs out of tokens, and sips power. \n\nBest part is you can buy out the lease at the end of the lease for a $0 penalty. That's right 0% interest.\n\nSo if the price is $12.9K and your lease is $9.9K over 36 months, then you pay the $3K difference and you now own that device.\n\nOr you can trade up into the M8 Ultra or whatever.\n\nI'm excited for this. 1.2 TB/s is pretty impressive. Can't wait to see some real benchmarks and testing on this.\n\nI'm waiting for the 512GB."
        },
